# Keyboard emulation ONLY for ITGmania's "Config Key/Joy Mappings" screen,
# whose cursor navigation is hardcoded to the keyboard device, and for the
# exit hotkey. Gameplay and menus read the pad itself (SDL game controller,
# Joy1 in Keymaps.ini). Never bind these keys in Keymaps.ini: one press would
# reach the engine as two GameButtons, which corrupts note judging.
a = space
b = backspace
x = tab
y = z
l1 = q
l2 = 1
r1 = w
r2 = 2

start = enter
back = esc

up = up
down = down
left = left
right = right
